<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">- Saafi-Saafi</book>
  <para style="h">Filemoon</para>
  <para style="toc3">Fim</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filemoon</para>
  <para style="toc1">Fiisi Pool kaɓɗoh Filemoon</para>
  <para style="mt">Fiisi Pool kaɓɗoh Filemoon</para>
  <para style="is">Rangsohaani</para>
  <para style="ip">Pool ɓaahee ŋ Israayel ci, ŋ cuuɓiŋ Benyaamin.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:1">Ɓi Rom 11:1</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Ɓi Filippi 3:5</ref></char></note> A nikee <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char>.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:6">Tum ci 23:6</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Ɓi Filippi 3:5</ref></char></note> Ŋ finho <char style="w">Paantakot</char>, wi Janguuni camb ɓaatuk, a ɓaahee ŋ ɓi tolfiɗee kosiɗ ci.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:58-8:3">Tum ci 7:58–8:3</ref></char></note> Waaye wa raakka mbeh, a cohha na Yeesu, a kossa<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:1-30">Tum ci 9:1-30</ref></char></note> po a nikka <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> sah. Teerndiŋ "Tum ciŋ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci" teeɓohiɗ pangkiŋ ɗe wi a nik <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ini kooɗoh ŋ saar 13.</para>
  <para style="ip">Filemoon nikee nawle Pool, te findi Pool, a pangkee wuu <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char>. Kahan ce nikee cohohaaniŋ ɓi Janguuni.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHM 1:1-2">Filemoon 1:1-2</ref></char></note> Filemoon a yi heɗ <char style="w" lemma="ñaam">ñaami</char> na woyse Onesim,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHM 1:16">Filemoon 1:16</ref></char></note> waaye Onesim saandohha. Onesim cohha na Pool, a kossa Yeesu. Pool woosa Onesim ne a wiirkaat ŋ heɗ ce na kaɓɗohi a na hee ɗe fiisɗe. Ini uupiɗ etoh ŋ fiisi Pool kaɓɗoh weem, a kiim Filemoon ne a taambkoh Onesim moɗoɗ, findi taambɗoh ce yi ɓaah na ɗe kos. Ŋ jamanoonaam ñaam saandoheen ɗah, a meeɗ atte'u findi ɓoyi ap ɓo', a miniɗ sah apu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Filemoon genee Kolos, te wa mand haa ne Onesim hunee na Tisikos wi a kee wika kaɓɗohii na kaɓɗohi Pool fiis ɓi Kolos.</para>
  <para style="iot">Fiisi Pool kaɓɗoh Filemoon kaɗtiɗoh an :</para>
  <para style="io1">- Kañɗoh na kiimiɗ barke <char style="ior"><ref loc="PHM 1:1-3">1:1-3</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Waaɗi na kosiŋ Filemoon <char style="ior"><ref loc="PHM 1:4-7">1:4-7</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Pool kiimiɗ Filemoon ne a teyɗuk Onesim <char style="ior"><ref loc="PHM 1:8-22">1:8-22</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Askohi <char style="ior"><ref loc="PHM 1:23-25">1:23-25</ref></char></para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1" />
  <para style="s">Kañɗohi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1" />Mi yii kañiɗ ɗa Filemoon, mi yi Pool, yi ambu ŋ kaso sagu taambiɗ woo kiŋ <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> Yeesu, mi na ɓaah ɓoo Timoote, e ɓoo na fiise kaytii wuu fu, fu yi ɓoo keeñkoh te ɓoo ɓaahha na ɗa pangkiŋ Kooh, <verse eid="PHM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2" />ɓoo ɓii kañiɗ ɗa fu na Apiyaa ɓaah ɓoo ɓitiɓ, na Arsip yi ɓaah na ɓoo hiñohi ɓoo na hiñohe, na ɓaah ciŋ ɓoo kosiɗ ci na cohe ŋ kahan fu jen.<verse eid="PHM 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3" />Kooh Baabiŋ ɓoo baahohaat ɗu, a on ɗu jam, Yeesu Kiristaa Heɗi baahohaat ɗu, a on ɗu jam.<verse eid="PHM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waaɗi na kosiŋ Filemoon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4" />Mi na gene corkiɗ Koohiŋ ngo, ne ŋ kiimee po ŋ woo tiikiŋ ɗa ɗah. <verse eid="PHM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5" />Ŋ kerhiɗ kosi fu kos Yeesu Heɗi na waaɗi fu waaɗ <char style="w">ɓo'-Kooh ci</char> jen. <verse eid="PHM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6" />Mi na kiime Kooh ne kosi ɓoo ɓaah rim in nga ɗa, fu uup inah in ci baahiɗ ci jen, ci ɓoo min tum wuu Kiristaani. <verse eid="PHM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7" />Laam, ŋ sumiɗ lool ƴaariŋ ngo te heliŋ ngo daliɗ ŋ findi fu na teeɓohe waaɗi fu waaɗ ɓooɓi, fu soosɗiɗ keeñ ciŋ ɓo'-Kooh ci.<verse eid="PHM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pool kiimiɗ Filemoon ne a teyɗuk Onesim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8" />Weɗ tah, ini maa hee ɗa woye, ŋ degɗaa ŋ kikilifaaki ŋ eɗu ŋ Kiristaani ne ŋ woo ɗa fu tum ini lah waas, <verse eid="PHM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9" />waaye ŋ waaɗ ɗa wa kiim sagu waaɗohi nik ŋ harmban ɓoo. E ñam na kiimee ɗa wa, mi yi Pool, ŋ niki ŋ nik yakak, ɓaatta nga ŋ ambi ŋ ambu wii sagu taambiɗ woo kiŋ Kiristaani Yeesu.<verse eid="PHM 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10" />Mi na kiimee ɗa wuu Onesim, yi ŋ amb findi kuɓkiŋ ngo yi ŋ raakoh ŋ kasooni. <verse eid="PHM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11" />Ɗeɓgaan a raakɗeeɗi ɗa njiriñ, ali nik ne tiikiŋ ɗe tokis njiriñ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">"ali nik ne tiikiŋ ɗe tokis njiriñ" : ngaŋ gerek, woo kii nikɗi ŋ Fiis ci ndii, waaye weɗ toksiŋ Onesim.</char></note>, waaye ɗiski wa nik a raakɗiɗ ɓoo njiriñ mi na ɗa. <verse eid="PHM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12" />Mi yii wik ɗa ɗe, a yi fu inah ne a usiɗ ŋ keeñiŋ ngo.<verse eid="PHM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13" />Ŋ waaɗeen ɗe amb ŋ serooso ne a tufkiɗ ɗa ndii a ɓaatɗohee so, fu hot nga mi yii ŋ kasooni sagu <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char>. <verse eid="PHM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14" />Waaye ŋ woyee ŋ haf fo ne ŋ waaɗɗi tum ali in te fu hunɗi nga, ne ini baahiɗi fu tuman nikuu ne fu ɓeku ɓeku nga waaye wa ini fu waaɗoot tum.<verse eid="PHM 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15" />Te wa miniɗ nik ne a saɓsohseen na ɗa ƴissuut ne fu wikuu ɗe a nik yiŋ ɗa kotii po faw. <verse eid="PHM 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16" />A nikissanɗi findi <char style="w">ñaam</char> dong, waaye a hey uupe ineem, a nikan ɓaahi keeñkohu ; weɗ a nik keeh-keeh nga so, mi yi sah, kon mbaa a uupan nik ineem nga ɗa fu yi heɗ ce, fu yi ɓaah ce ŋ Heɗi ! <verse eid="PHM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17" />Kon nik ne fu ambiɗ to findi nawleefu ɗah, teyɗukaa ɗe po mand haa a ñam.<verse eid="PHM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18" />Nik ne a tumiɗ ɗa in yurhaaɗi wala nik ne a raakɗohiɗ ɗa kombot ɗah, ŋ deggiɗ ca. <verse eid="PHM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19" />Mi Pool, mi yii fiis na yaahiŋ ngo ne : <char style="sig">Ñam na hee ɗa wa wirnde, mi ŋ haf fo.</char> Ŋ sang ɗa woo rek ne fu ŋ haf fu, fu raakɗohiɗ to kombot ; fu raakɗohiɗ to kipes kiŋ ɗa. <verse eid="PHM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20" />Ee, ɓaah ho, raakiɗ to njiriñ sagu Heɗi ɓoo ɓaah, dalɗa heliŋ ngo ŋ Kiristaani.<verse eid="PHM 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21" />Ɗiski mi na fiise kaytii, wa wooriɗ to ne fu hey tume ini ŋ kiim ɗa, ŋ inhiɗ ne fu hey tume ini uup sah ineem. <verse eid="PHM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22" />Namaa so kooɗkiɗ daloha ; ŋ ambiɗ yaakaar ne ŋ hey ɗu wikse sagu kiim ciŋ ɗu Kooh.<verse eid="PHM 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Askohi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23" />Epafras, yi taƴu na so sagu niki a nik ŋ Kiristaani Yeesu, yii kañiɗ ɗa, <verse eid="PHM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24" />a yi na Maarko, na Aristarka, na Demaas na Luk, ɓi ɓaah na so pangki. <verse eid="PHM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25" />Yeesu Kiristaa Heɗi baahohaat ɗu.<verse eid="PHM 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1" />
</usx>